<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n85294" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολύ-ρριζος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>with many roots,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>HP</u>
				9.10.2
			</span></i>, Epigr. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				5.48
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Anyt.
			</span></i>); <i>full of roots,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γῆ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Gp.</u>
					3.10.8
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>bearing many</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥίζαι,</span> i.e. <i>fertile in herbs.</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Str.
				5.3.6
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				15.1.22
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> metaph.,
				<i>firmly rooted,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολιτεία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.787f
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>fibrous,</i> of tissue in malignant disease, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Mul.</u>
				2.156
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολύρριζον, τό,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑλλέβορος μέλας</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				4.162
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πτερίς</span>
			, ib.<i><span class="en">
				184
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιμήδιον</span>
			, Ps.-<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				4.19
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
